        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "Google DeepMind has released two new Gemini text-to-speech models, `gemini-3.8-flash-tts` and `gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts`.",
          "zh": "Google DeepMind 发布了两款新的 Gemini 文本转语音模型：`gemini-3.8-flash-tts` 和 `gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts`。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Two new models, `gemini-3.8-flash-tts` and `gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts`, have been released.",
            "The models include a library of over 2,000 pre-existing voices.",
            "Custom voices can be created from a 30-second audio sample."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "两款新模型，`gemini-3.8-flash-tts` 和 `gemini-3.8-flash-lite-tts`，已正式发布。",
            "这些模型内置了超过 2,000 种预设声音库。",
            "支持通过 30 秒的音频样本创建自定义声音。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "The introduction of these new text-to-speech models expands the available options for voice generation, potentially enabling more diverse and personalized auditory experiences in AI applications.",
          "zh": "这些新型文本转语音模型的推出扩展了语音生成领域的现有选项，可能在AI应用中实现更多样化和个性化的听觉体验。"
        },
        "source": "Google DeepMind",
        "link": "https://deepmind.google/blog/say-hello-to-gemini-38-text-to-speech/"
      },
